Write the agent skill into an agent config dir so a coding agent can use this tool

Usage: android-doctor doctor install [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --agent <AGENT>  Which agent to install for; omit to print where each one would go
      --no-color       Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --print-only     Print the skill instead of writing it
  -h, --help           Print help
